msgctxt "Item:9344:0:9"
msgid "Wind-up Ultros"
msgstr "Заводной Ультрос"

#. ja: マメット・スノーマン
#. de: Zuckerschneemann
#. fr: bébé bonhomme de neige
#. column 2: Hoary the Snowman
#. column 8: Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag.<br><br>Use item to acquire the Hoary the Snowman minion.
#. column 9: Hoary the Snowman
msgctxt "Item:9345:0:0"
msgid "Hoary the Snowman"
msgstr "Седой снеговик"

#. de: Zuckerschneemänner
#. fr: bébés bonhommes de neige
#. column 0: Hoary the Snowman
#. column 8: Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag.<br><br>Use item to acquire the Hoary the Snowman minion.
#. column 9: Hoary the Snowman
msgctxt "Item:9345:0:2"
msgid "Hoary the Snowman"
msgstr "Седые снеговики"

#. ja: ミニオン修得<br>雪だるまを模した魔法人形。サヨナラナノダ……
#. de: Goldschmiede und Gourmets arbeiteten beim Bau dieser zuckersüßen Marionette Hand in Hand. Dank karamelisiertem Finish eignet sich dieser wohlerzogene Begleiter auch für Spaziergänge durch Thanalan.<br><br>Benutze diesen Gegenstand, um den Zuckerschneemann zu rufen.
#. fr: [Mascotte]<br>Ce pantin en forme de bonhomme de neige a tendance à fondre au soleil, comme l'original.
#. column 0: Hoary the Snowman
#. column 2: Hoary the Snowman
#. column 9: Hoary the Snowman
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:9345:0:8"
msgid "Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag.<br><br>Use item to acquire the Hoary the Snowman minion."
msgstr "Седой снеговик был весёлой душой — без трубки и носа, с глазами не из угля. Наверное, из шлака.<br><br>Используйте предмет, чтобы получить Седого снеговика."

