#. de: Zuckerschneemann
#. fr: Bébé bonhomme de neige
#. column 0: Hoary the Snowman
#. column 2: Hoary the Snowman
#. column 8: Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag.<br><br>Use item to acquire the Hoary the Snowman minion.
msgctxt "Item:9345:0:9"
msgid "Hoary the Snowman"
msgstr "Седой снеговик"

#. ja: ポチャチョコボ
#. de: Chocopummelchen
#. fr: bébé chocobo grassouillet
#. column 2: heavy hatchlings
#. column 8: Currently, “baby fat” is the prevailing excuse for this cherubic chick's gigant-like girth.<br><br>Use item to acquire the heavy hatchling minion.
#. column 9: Heavy Hatchling
msgctxt "Item:9346:0:0"
msgid "heavy hatchling"
msgstr "тяжёлый птенец"

