msgstr "Птенчик"

#. ja: ファットキャット
#. de: dick[a] Katze
#. fr: gros minou
#. column 2: fat catz
#. column 8: Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not).<br><br>Use item to acquire the fat cat minion.
#. column 9: Fat Cat
msgctxt "Item:9347:0:0"
msgid "fat cat"
msgstr "толстый кот"

#. de: dick[a] Katze
#. fr: gros minous
#. column 0: fat cat
#. column 8: Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not).<br><br>Use item to acquire the fat cat minion.
#. column 9: Fat Cat
msgctxt "Item:9347:0:2"
msgid "fat catz"
msgstr "толстые коты"

#. ja: ミニオン修得<br>おでぶな子猫。意外と素早い
#. de: Trotz überzeugender Studien von Spitzenwissenschaftlern aus ganz Eorzea weigern sich die meisten Miqo'te-Gelehrten, an die Theorie zu glauben, ihr Volk könnte von Katzen abstammen (egal ob dick oder nicht).<br><br>Benutze diesen Gegenstand, um die dicke Katze zu rufen.
#. fr: [Mascotte]<br>Un chaton avec pas mal d'embonpoint, mais qui sait se déplacer rapidement.
#. column 0: fat cat
#. column 2: fat catz
#. column 9: Fat Cat
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:9347:0:8"
msgid "Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not).<br><br>Use item to acquire the fat cat minion."
msgstr "Несмотря на убедительные исследования лучших учёных со всего света, большинство учёных-микоте отказывается верить, что их народ может быть в родстве с кошками — толстыми или худыми.<br><br>Используйте предмет, чтобы получить прислужника «Толстый кот»."

