msgstr "Толстый кот"

#. ja: リトルフット
#. de: Kleinfuß
#. fr: petit yéti
#. column 2: Littlefeet
#. column 8: This particular yeti is content in knowing that bigger is not always necessarily better.<br><br>Use item to acquire the Littlefoot minion.
#. column 9: Littlefoot
msgctxt "Item:9348:0:0"
msgid "Littlefoot"
msgstr "малыш Йети"

