#. ja: リトルマミー
#. de: Mini-Mumie
#. fr: mini-momie
#. column 2: mummy's little mummies
#. column 8: While as cute as a button, remember, mummies are ultimately embalmed corpses damned to eternal thralldom in the land of the living. Have fun.<br><br>Use item to acquire the mummy's little mummy minion.
#. column 9: Mummy's Little Mummy
msgctxt "Item:9349:0:0"
msgid "mummy's little mummy"
msgstr "малыш мумии"

#. de: Mini-Mumien
#. fr: mini-momies
#. column 0: mummy's little mummy
#. column 8: While as cute as a button, remember, mummies are ultimately embalmed corpses damned to eternal thralldom in the land of the living. Have fun.<br><br>Use item to acquire the mummy's little mummy minion.
#. column 9: Mummy's Little Mummy
msgctxt "Item:9349:0:2"
msgid "mummy's little mummies"
msgstr "малыши мумии"

#. ja: ミニオン修得<br>包帯でぐるぐる巻きにされた人形。なぜか動く
#. de: Ungemein niedlich, aber denk daran: Mumien sind immer noch einbalsamierte Leichname, die auf ewig dazu verdammt sind, im Diesseits umherzuschlurfen. Viel Spaß!<br><br>Benutze diesen Gegenstand, um die Mini-Mumie zu rufen.
#. fr: [Mascotte]<br>Une poupée mortuaire qui a été recouverte de bandages et semble pourtant bien vivante.
#. column 0: mummy's little mummy
#. column 2: mummy's little mummies
#. column 9: Mummy's Little Mummy
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:9349:0:8"
msgid "While as cute as a button, remember, mummies are ultimately embalmed corpses damned to eternal thralldom in the land of the living. Have fun.<br><br>Use item to acquire the mummy's little mummy minion."
msgstr "Какая же милая! Только не забывайте: мумии — это забальзамированные трупы, обречённые вечно служить живым. Удачи!<br><br>Используйте предмет, чтобы получить прислужника «Малыш мумии»."

