msgstr "Малыш мумии"

#. ja: アサシンフライ
#. de: fliegend[a] Kampffisch
#. fr: fretin assassin
#. column 2: assassin fry
#. column 8: There was an old betta who swallowed a fry. No one knows why it swallowed the fry, but for some reason, the fry can now fly.<br><br>Use item to acquire the assassin fry minion.
#. column 9: Assassin Fry
msgctxt "Item:9350:0:0"
msgid "assassin fry"
msgstr "малёк-убийца"

#. de: fliegend[a] Kampffische
