#. ja: カッパッパ
#. de: Flusskobold
#. fr: petit kappa
#. column 2: water imps
#. column 8: Legend states these strange creatures can only survive on land as long as the plate atop their heads remains wet.<br><br>Use item to acquire the water imp minion.
#. column 9: Water Imp
msgctxt "Item:9351:0:0"
msgid "water imp"
msgstr "водяной бес"

#. de: Flusskobolde
