#. de: Aufzieh-Louisoix
#. fr: Louisoix miniature
#. column 2: wind-up Louisoixs
#. column 8: The Seventh Astral Era is secure as long as the Archon is ever at our sides.<br><br>Use item to acquire the wind-up Louisoix minion.
