#. ja: アラグの魔触媒
#. de: allagisch[a] Katalysator
#. fr: pot de catalyseur allagois
#. column 2: Allagan catalysts
#. column 8: Dubbed a “god in the machina” by those who first discovered it, modern scholars have yet to discover not only what the catalytic agent contains, but exactly how it functions, understanding only that the substance is required to strengthen the properties of certain materials.
#. column 9: Allagan Catalyst
msgctxt "Item:9376:0:0"
msgid "Allagan catalyst"
msgstr "аллаганский катализатор"

#. de: allagisch[a] Katalysatoren
#. fr: pots de catalyseur allagois
#. column 0: Allagan catalyst
#. column 8: Dubbed a “god in the machina” by those who first discovered it, modern scholars have yet to discover not only what the catalytic agent contains, but exactly how it functions, understanding only that the substance is required to strengthen the properties of certain materials.
#. column 9: Allagan Catalyst
msgctxt "Item:9376:0:2"
msgid "Allagan catalysts"
msgstr "аллаганские катализаторы"

#. ja: 古代アラグ帝国が編み出した魔科学の産物。装備品や薬品を製造する際の触媒らしい
#. de: Die Gelehrten haben noch immer nicht herausgefunden, woraus dieser Katalysator besteht, oder wie genau er funktioniert. Sicher ist nur, dass die Substanz benötigt wird, um die Eigenschaften gewisser Materialien zu verbessern.
#. fr: Un produit mis au point par les anciens Allagois. Il est utilisé comme catalyseur dans le processus de fabrication d'équipements et de remèdes.
#. column 0: Allagan catalyst
#. column 2: Allagan catalysts
#. column 9: Allagan Catalyst
msgctxt "Item:9376:0:8"
msgid "Dubbed a “god in the machina” by those who first discovered it, modern scholars have yet to discover not only what the catalytic agent contains, but exactly how it functions, understanding only that the substance is required to strengthen the properties of certain materials."
msgstr "Первые, кто обнаружил это вещество, прозвали его «богом в машине». Современные учёные до сих пор не выяснили ни состав катализатора, ни принцип его действия. Известно лишь, что он усиливает свойства некоторых материалов."

