#. de: Rowena-Marke[p] „Poesie“
#. fr: avoir de Rowena (poétique)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (poetics)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Poetics)
msgctxt "Item:9383:0:0"
msgid "Rowena's token (poetics)"
msgstr "расписка Ровены (поэтика)"

#. de: Rowena-Marken[p] „Poesie“
#. fr: avoirs de Rowena (poétiques)
#. column 0: Rowena's token (poetics)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Poetics)
msgctxt "Item:9383:0:2"
msgid "Rowena's tokens (poetics)"
msgstr "расписки Ровены (поэтика)"

#. ja: アラガントームストーン:詩学を納品した証となる商人ロウェナの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Rowena für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Poesie ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Rowena des mémoquartz allagois poétiques. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Rowena's token (poetics)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (poetics)
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Poetics)
msgctxt "Item:9383:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Расписка, полученная от Ровены за сдачу аллаганских камней поэтики. После смены правил Дома великолепия она теперь стоит меньше бумаги, на которой написана."

