#. fr: mémoquartz allagois crypté
#. column 2: encrypted tomestones
#. column 8: While Garlond Ironworks engineers insist tomestones contain reams of invaluable information gathered by the lost Allagan Empire, even they are at a loss how to decipher the content of this particular one. This variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Encrypted Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:9384:0:0"
msgid "encrypted tomestone"
msgstr "зашифрованный аллаганский камень"

#. de: chiffriert[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
#. fr: mémoquartz allagois cryptés
#. column 0: encrypted tomestone
#. column 8: While Garlond Ironworks engineers insist tomestones contain reams of invaluable information gathered by the lost Allagan Empire, even they are at a loss how to decipher the content of this particular one. This variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Encrypted Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:9384:0:2"
msgid "encrypted tomestones"
msgstr "зашифрованные аллаганские камни"

#. ja: 古代の情報が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。内容が暗号化されている。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ingenieure der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke bestehen darauf, dass diese Steine Informationen von unschätzbarem Wert über das antike Allagische Reich enthalten, sind sich aber in diesem besonderen Fall nicht sicher, um welche Informationen es sich handeln könnte. Leider hat keiner mehr Interesse an diesen Objekten.
#. fr: Cette pierre gravée est pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment un vestige de la civilisation allagoise. Ce qu'elle contient est codé. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: encrypted tomestone
#. column 2: encrypted tomestones
#. column 9: Encrypted Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:9384:0:8"
msgid "While Garlond Ironworks engineers insist tomestones contain reams of invaluable information gathered by the lost Allagan Empire, even they are at a loss how to decipher the content of this particular one. This variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares."
msgstr "Инженеры «Топсейл» уверены, что в камнях хранятся бесценные сведения, собранные исчезнувшей Аллаганской империей. Но даже они не могут расшифровать этот экземпляр. Когда-то за такими камнями охотились коллекционеры, но теперь их уже не обменивают на товары."

#. ja: 暗号化トームストーン
#. de: Chiffrierter Allagischer Stein
#. fr: Mémoquartz allagois crypté
#. column 0: encrypted tomestone
#. column 2: encrypted tomestones
#. column 8: While Garlond Ironworks engineers insist tomestones contain reams of invaluable information gathered by the lost Allagan Empire, even they are at a loss how to decipher the content of this particular one. This variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
msgctxt "Item:9384:0:9"
msgid "Encrypted Tomestone"
msgstr "Зашифрованный томстоун"

#. ja: アラグの硬化薬
#. de: Flakon[p] Karbonlack
#. fr: fiole d'agent solidifiant allagois
#. column 2: flasks of carboncoat
#. column 8: Born of Allagan ingenuity, this aetherochemical concoction is said to increase a gem's hardness. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Carboncoat
msgctxt "Item:9385:0:0"
msgid "flask of carboncoat"
msgstr "флакон карбопокрытия"

#. de: Flakons[p] Karbonlack
