#. column 2: magicked prisms (petals)
#. column 9: Magicked Prism (Petals)
msgctxt "Item:9502:0:8"
msgid "This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Produces a shower of ephemeral flower petals."
