msgid "Oasis Breakfast"
msgstr "Завтрак оазиса"

#. ja: スキャッタードドキュメント
#. de: Stapel[p] verstreuter Dokumente
#. fr: ensemble de documents épars
#. column 2: assortments of scattered documents
#. column 8: This pile of parchment appears to be pages taken from <i>The Last Paean</i>─a detailed account of the life and times of a legendary bard who traveled the realm bringing joy to all he met. Strewn across one's bureau, the documents give any library or study a heightened air of sophistication.
#. column 9: Scattered Documents
msgctxt "Item:9729:0:0"
msgid "assortment of scattered documents"
msgstr "набор разбросанных бумаг"

#. de: Stapel[p] verstreuter Dokumente
#. fr: ensembles de documents épars
#. column 0: assortment of scattered documents
#. column 8: This pile of parchment appears to be pages taken from <i>The Last Paean</i>─a detailed account of the life and times of a legendary bard who traveled the realm bringing joy to all he met. Strewn across one's bureau, the documents give any library or study a heightened air of sophistication.
#. column 9: Scattered Documents
msgctxt "Item:9729:0:2"
msgid "assortments of scattered documents"
msgstr "наборы разбросанных бумаг"

#. ja: 前のめりな知性を演出するための、乱雑に散らばった研究書類
#. de: Die losen Blätter sind der Sammlung <i>Lobet den Lobgesang</i> entnommen - eine ausführliche Schilderung des Lebens und Wirkens eines legendären Barden, der durch die Lande zog und die Völker mit seinen Weisen erfreute. Verteilt in der Studienkammer eines Gelehrten würden sie den Eindruck intensiver Forschung vermitteln.
#. fr: Un amas de documents de recherche éparpillés, idéal pour donner une impression d'érudition.
#. column 0: assortment of scattered documents
#. column 2: assortments of scattered documents
#. column 9: Scattered Documents
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:9729:0:8"
msgid "This pile of parchment appears to be pages taken from <i>The Last Paean</i>─a detailed account of the life and times of a legendary bard who traveled the realm bringing joy to all he met. Strewn across one's bureau, the documents give any library or study a heightened air of sophistication."
msgstr "Эти пергаментные листы, похоже, вырваны из книги „<i>Последний гимн</i>“ — подробного жизнеописания легендарного барда, странствовавшего по миру и дарившего радость всем встречным. Разбросанные по столу бумаги придадут библиотеке или кабинету особенно учёный вид."

