#. ja: シュラウド・オールドウェル
#. de: trocken[a] Brunnen
#. fr: puits sombrelinçois
#. column 2: dried wells
#. column 8: Have you dreamed of owning your very own well, but are plagued by one or more of the following psychological ailments: acrophobia, claustrophobia, aquaphobia, bathophobia, or cleithrophobia? Well fear no longer. This quality stone well, manufactured in Eorzea with 100% Eorzean materials, requires no hole to be dug, no ground to be sanctified, and no chain letters to be passed along to your dearest enemies.
#. column 9: Dried Well
msgctxt "Item:9739:0:0"
msgid "dried well"
msgstr "сухой колодец"

