#. column 2: chocobo training manuals - Choco Dash I
#. column 8: A comprehensive manual detailing chocobo training methods developed by experts across the realm. Use to teach your race chocobo the ability <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Choco Dash</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Ability Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Temporarily boosts speed without depleting stamina.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1s
#. column 9: Chocobo Training Manual - Choco Dash I
msgctxt "Item:9852:0:0"
