msgid "A comprehensive manual detailing chocobo training methods developed by experts across the realm. Use to teach your race chocobo the trait <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Increased Stamina II</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Ability Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Reduces stamina depletion during acceleration by 12%."
